sequenceDiagram
  participant FE as Frontend (browser)
  participant API as API (AuthService)
  participant DB as DB (refresh_tokens)

  FE->>API: POST /auth/signin {email,password}
  API->>AuthService: validate credentials
  AuthService-->>DB: store jti_hash, expires_at
  API-->>FE: set-cookie(refreshToken), return accessToken

  FE->>API: GET /protected (Authorization: Bearer AT)
  API->>AuthService: verify AT via JWKS -> ok

  Note over FE,API: When AT expires
  FE->>API: POST /auth/refresh (cookie: RT)
  API->>AuthService: verify RT signature, get jti
  API->>DB: find matching jti_hash -> if match accept
  AuthService-->>DB: insert new jti_hash; revoke/delete old
  API-->>FE: set-cookie(new RT), return new AT

  FE->>API: POST /auth/logout
  API->>DB: revoke/delete RT records for device/user
  API-->>FE: clear cookies